            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A mold inspection or assessment typically costs roughly 300 to 1,000 dollars, depending on the size of the home, the number of samples and the region. A visual inspection with moisture readings sits at the low end, while extensive air and surface sampling with lab analysis sits at the high end. Clearance testing after remediation is often priced separately."
          }
